    Takes inputs: {'metric_code': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Unique identifier of the metric (e.g. "goodwill").'}, 'year': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Fiscal year of interest (e.g. 2008).'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
- compute_sum_tool: Compute the arithmetic sum of a list of numbers.
    Takes inputs: {'numbers': {'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'number'}, 'description': 'Sequence of numeric values to be added.'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
